    "detailed_description": "<h1>Join our Discord</h1><p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2748500/extras/813a176bfe9bc1568b759abf0bf21aa4.avif?t=1730127876\" width=616 height=155 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2748500/extras/901ccf5ddcd62d0955d8885b053fec39.poster.avif?t=1730127876\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2748500/extras/901ccf5ddcd62d0955d8885b053fec39.webm?t=1730127876\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2748500/extras/901ccf5ddcd62d0955d8885b053fec39.mp4?t=1730127876\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>After getting reincarnated as a goblin in a world ruled by two rival clans, you embrace your kinkiest side and embark on a sexual adventure to keep breeding beautiful girls to assemble your army of goblins, defeat both clans, and rule this new world as the proud goblin you are.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2748500/extras/8cf1f9e06e1a9d85a140087f1f7ea522.avif?t=1730127876\" width=616 height=155 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2748500/extras/9d0ab067dabfb82a2146a2ae1b925409.poster.avif?t=1730127876\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2748500/extras/9d0ab067dabfb82a2146a2ae1b925409.webm?t=1730127876\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2748500/extras/9d0ab067dabfb82a2146a2ae1b925409.mp4?t=1730127876\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>The most beautiful girls from this new world will try to stop you from achieving your goal. Defeat them all and prepare to have as much sex as you can withstand with them. Have your way in and breed them non-stop until you build your goblin army.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2748500/extras/40d12f4adf3247687a6c39a2d9cff0db.avif?t=1730127876\" width=616 height=155 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2748500/extras/5599b6975149a7e13838a8ed88e02230.poster.avif?t=1730127876\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2748500/extras/5599b6975149a7e13838a8ed88e02230.webm?t=1730127876\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2748500/extras/5599b6975149a7e13838a8ed88e02230.mp4?t=1730127876\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>You will face many enemies in different battle scenarios during your adventures. This visual novel features a turn-based combat system! Be sure to prepare your troops, explore the world map, make the best decisions to achieve victory, and, of course, keep breeding more and more to increase your army!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2748500/extras/e91e7e0b0c8e11eff14e4c1822b04697.avif?t=1730127876\" width=616 height=155 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2748500/extras/498781db48a3f3d001ca5ab6cd26dac6.poster.avif?t=1730127876\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2748500/extras/498781db48a3f3d001ca5ab6cd26dac6.webm?t=1730127876\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span>Featuring a ton of high-quality hentai scenes, your adventures as a globin are going to be wild. Each girl will bring tasty kinks for your goblin tastes as you have your way with each one of them, bringing their lust to new heights!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Join our discord</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2748500/extras/7e53e2943285946c38c0ac8f95372fa3.avif?t=1730127876\" width=600 height=166 /></span></p>",
